ells to turn the tide in battle. Only by fully restoring each area will you truly stop the corruption and let nature flourish again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123650/extras/d3af29bca624613524303f04e81a8c8b.poster.avif?t=1781243168\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123650/extras/d3af29bca624613524303f04e81a8c8b.webm?t=1781243168\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Team up with a friend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the adventure solo or team up with a friend in online co-op mode. Combine your strengths and work together to defend against corruption and explore the game's magical world. Coordinate your strategies, share resources and discover secrets as you restore the world side by side.</p>", "short_description": "Restore nature in this cozy tower defense game. Slip into the role of Sprig – a scarecrow brought to life with magic. Plant your defenses to bring back the vibrant life this world once held and uncover its secrets. Grow, Defend, Restore!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123650/cf6000cf77609bd26f7398645d93c1b97373a1c2/header.jpg?t=1781243168", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123650/71577b81ee0766000bcb8cf0129bc3657effd6dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781243168", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3123650/71577b81ee0766000bcb8cf0129bc3657effd6dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781243168", "website": "https://www.neobird.de/growing-wild-landing", "pc_requirements":